<title>HONG KONG: Dongfang 1996 profit down 36 percent.</title>
<headline>Dongfang 1996 profit down 36 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		 0.126  vs  0.212</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)	  0.10   vs  0.12</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			  56.81  vs  89.11</p>
<p>    Turnover		   647.19 vs  582.79</p>
<p>    Company name	     Dongfang Electrical Machinery Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		May 19 to June 18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 June 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Dongfang Electrical Machinery is a China-incorporated maker of generators.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 0.10 yuan vs 0.12 yuan.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
